                                "sense_id": "bdf8c944-265c-3755-a17e-65ff1d93f71c",
                                "text": "In some insects different cell types can be identified microscopically within the cardia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be31434d-63bb-48c8-ad3a-680987ad8cc9",
                                "sense_id": "bdf8c944-265c-3755-a17e-65ff1d93f71c",
                                "text": "The first one is stripping from up to down for tumours in the cardias, the other one is stripping from down to up for cervical esophageal cancer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "859f56da-9e44-4c78-8398-08112a957629",
                                "sense_id": "bdf8c944-265c-3755-a17e-65ff1d93f71c",
                                "text": "After several rinses in fresh culture medium the cardiae were transferred to sterilized vessels with culture medium which had been sterilized by filtration."
                            }
                        ]
